  "body": "https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#the-webkit-background-clip-property\n\n> (including decorations and shadows).\n> Can we not include shadow here?\n> Two reason\n> 1. Chrome doesn't include shadow\n> 2. If we include shadow here, we can't use text-path-clip, instead, we have to generate a mask from \"text+text shadow\", which is slower compare to text-path-clip\n",
